collection":"Cable","collection":"fabric-electrical-cable","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/61emBe5uftL_cf884240-a436-4bcb-b081-6ad445c8a063_1.jpg"}},"collection_item_q9NBFz":{"type":"collection_item","settings":{"title_collection":"","collection":"living-room-lighting","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/71gqCxk7eBS.jpg"}}},"block_order":["collection_item_Vap9T3","collection_item_Jkegxh","template--16652384076023__d22b349b-1e5c-4e9d-86c3-1f962770d193-167057601917b746bf-2","collection_item_q9NBFz"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[],"settings":{"heading_logo_svg":"","subheading":"","heading":"","description":"","text_alignment":"text-center","container":"container","color_scheme":"default-color-scheme","design_collection":"design-1","hover_effect":"zoom","show_count_product":false,"image_ratio":"4\/3","custom_ratio":"21:9","column_gap":10,"padding_top":30,"padding_bottom":20,"reset_spacing":true}},"d26d322e-32a3-4756-bbe9-907d92d061dd":{"type":"testimonial","blocks":{"testimonials_Hd9Ey4":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"title_text":"I absolutely love these shades!","description":"<p>They were the perfect replacement for the glass ones that were accidentally broken by my son. The quality and finish are excellent, they fit my pendants perfectly, and the black finish coordinates beautifully with my existing fixtures. Great value...highly recommend!<br\/><\/p>","author":"","job":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_1.jpg","testimonial_width":100,"link":"shopify:\/\/products\/metal-pendant-light-shade"}},"testimonials_D7ECYN":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"title_text":"great purchase","description":"<p>Great seller - great product. Thank you!<\/p>","author":"","job":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_8ab207fd-b8b7-475a-8903-ed134f3cc15b.jpg","testimonial_width":100,"link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dome-ceiling-pendant-light"}},"template--21390855831849__d26d322e-32a3-4756-bbe9-907d92d061dd-testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"title_text":"","description":"<p>Ideal item to repair an equivalent broken lamp holder. One small snag was that the shipped item wasn't quite the same as that in the listing as it lacked the fixed collar (see picture). Contacted the seller who....<\/p>","author":"","job":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Bulb_Holder_Small_Screw_E14_SES_Black_White_Plastic_Lamp_holder_For_Table_Lamp.webp","testimonial_width":100,"link":""}},"testimonials_kiCckU":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"title_text":"","description":"<p>Awesome buy already installed ....they came totally complete...with Antique lamp bulbs, Fixings & mounting brackets all you need to add was an electrician to install them....also delivery was good all arrived on time. .... Picture shows light fitting but I used conduit & glands .... instead of the supplied pattresses.<\/p>","author":"","job":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/12_2ed03bd4-1805-4ac5-8772-2d9c04b3f4b9.webp","testimonial_width":100,"link":""}},"template--21390855831849__d26d322e-32a3-4756-bbe9-907d92d061dd-testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"title_text":"","description":"<p>Nice quality light fitting. Some assembly is required. As an electrical engineer I would suggest using WAGO 221 connectors with ferrules, not Choc Block connectors. It will make installation much easier...🥰<\/p>","author":"","job":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_02fa77a6-d4db-4c07-8459-0ac31059ce93.webp","testimonial_width":70,"link":""}},"template--21390855831849__d26d322e-32a3-4756-bbe9-907d92d061dd-testimonials-3":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"title_text":"","description":"<p>These shades are excellent value, fast delivery, buy with confidence from this seller. I make upcycled lamps and use this sellers shades, see photo..<\/p>","author":"","job":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_0dcbca39-a196-4501-99ed-2eabad3b86b3.jpg","testimonial_width":70,"link":""}},"testimonials_pEgeEA":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"title_text":"","description":"<p>Arrived wel